{# BJJ Submission Family Hub Page Template #}
{# Generates family overview pages with variant comparison table #}
{# Input: Root fields + variants_comparison (aggregated from variant JSONs) #}

---
title: "{{ name }} | BJJ Submission Family | BJJ Graph"
description: "{{ description }}"
---

{# PostHog A/B Testing Metadata #}
<body data-content-type="submissions-family">

> **SAFETY**: {{ name }} targets the {{ target_area }}. Risk: {{ safety_considerations.injury_risks[0].injury }}. Release immediately upon tap.

{# Flexbox wrapper for A/B testing #}
<main class="content-wrapper" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

{% if (aliases is defined and aliases) or (family is defined and family) or (disambiguations is defined and disambiguations) -%}
<aside class="entity-relations">
{%- if aliases is defined and aliases %}
<p class="also-known-as"><em>Also known as:</em> {% for alias in aliases %}<strong>{{ alias | e }}</strong>{{ ", " if not loop.last else "" }}{% endfor %}</p>
{%- endif %}
{%- if family is defined and family %}
<p class="part-of-family"><em>Part of the</em> <strong>{% if resolve.family_exists(family) %}[[Families/{{ family }}|{{ family | e }}]]{% else %}{{ family | e }}{% endif %}</strong> <em>family</em></p>
{%- endif %}
{%- if disambiguations is defined and disambiguations %}
{%- for d in disambiguations %}
<p class="often-confused-with"><em>Often confused with</em> <strong>{% if resolve.page_exists(d.name) %}[[{{ resolve(d.name) }}|{{ d.name | e }}]]{% else %}{{ d.name | e }}{% endif %}</strong> — {{ d.reason | e }}</p>
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
</aside>
{% endif -%}

{% if variants_comparison %}
<section id="variants" class="content-section">

## Position Variants

| From Position | Success Rate | Top Injury Risk | Key Difference |
|---------------|-------------|-----------------|----------------|
{% for v in variants_comparison -%}
| [[{{ name }}/{{ v.variant_name }}|{{ v.from_position.split('/')[0] if '/' in v.from_position else v.from_position }}]] | {{ v.success_rate }}% | {{ v.top_risk }} | {{ v.uniqueness }} |
{% endfor %}

</section>
{% endif %}

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

{{ overview }}

**Category**: {{ submission_category }}
**Type**: {{ submission_type }}
**Target Area**: {{ target_area }}
**Success Rate**: {{ success_rate }}% (average across variants)

</section>

<section id="safety-considerations" class="content-section">

## Safety Guide

**Injury Risks**:

| Injury | Severity | Recovery Time |
|--------|----------|---------------|
{% for risk in safety_considerations.injury_risks -%}
| {{ risk.injury }} | {{ risk.severity }} | {{ risk.recovery_time }} |
{% endfor %}

**Application Speed**: {{ safety_considerations.application_speed }}

**Tap Signals**:
{% for signal in safety_considerations.tap_signals -%}
- {{ signal }}
{% endfor %}

**Release Protocol**:
{% for step in safety_considerations.release_protocol -%}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ step }}
{% endfor %}

**Training Restrictions**:
{% for restriction in safety_considerations.training_restrictions -%}
- {{ restriction }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

{% if variations_and_setups is defined and variations_and_setups %}
<section id="variation-details" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Variation Details

{% for variant in variations_and_setups %}
**{{ variant.variation_name }}**: {{ variant.description }}{% if variant.when_to_use %} (When to use: {{ variant.when_to_use }}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>
{% endif %}

<section id="from-positions" class="content-section">

## From Which Positions?

{% for position in from_positions -%}
- [[{{ resolve(position) }}]]
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="related-submissions" class="content-section">

## Related Submissions

{% for submission in related_submissions -%}
- [[{{ resolve(submission.name if submission is mapping else submission) }}]]{% if submission is mapping and submission.relationship %} - {{ submission.relationship }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="related-content" class="content-section">

## Additional Related Content

{% for item in related_content -%}
- [[{{ resolve(item.name) }}]] - {{ item.relationship }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="terminal-state" class="content-section">

## Match Outcome

Successful execution of {{ name }} leads to → [[game-over|Game Over]]

*All submissions in BJJ ultimately converge to the same terminal state: the match ends when your opponent taps.*

</section>

</main>
